%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
\section{General Aspects}
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
\bi
	\ite typical feature of microcontroller are the various interfaces
	\ite every interface are controlled by one or more register which are part of the standard memory space 
	\ite most of the interfaces could generate an interrupt (use an according interrupt service routine to program some actions)
	\ite every interface has a flag also which makes it possible to write programs to ask in a ``polling method'' for interaction with the interface 
	\ite to reduce the number of external pins, mostly the input/output pins are double or tripled used
	\ite this means the number of interfaces are also reduced
\ei


%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
\section{Digital Ports}
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
\bi
	\ite the microcontroller CFV4e has a lot of digital input/output lines (interfaces)
	\ite these lines are grouped in 8 bit, 7 bit, 5 bit and 4 bit ports.
	\ite every port is programmable as an input or an output port.
	\ite an mix of input line and output lines in one port is allowed
	\ite the output lines are driven in a ``Pushpull-mode'' (this means a connection of two or more output lines isn't possible)
	\os{\newpage}
	\ite  8 bit Ports (Portlines \_x[7 .. 0])
\ei
\begin{center}
	\begin{tabular}{c c c c c c}
	  Port  & Addr. PODR\_x & Addr. PDDR\_x & Addr. PPDSDR\_x & Addr PCLR\_x \\
	 \hline
	  FBCTL  & A000 & A010 & A020 & A030 \\
	  FEC0H  & A004 & A014 & A024 & A034 \\
	  FEC0L  & A005 & A015 & A025 & A035 \\
	  FEC1H  & A006 & A016 & A026 & A036 \\
	  FEC1L  & A007 & A017 & A027 & A037 \\
	  PSC3PSC2  & A00C & A01C & A02C & A03C \\
	  PSC1PSC0  & A00D & A01D & A02D & A03D \\
	\end{tabular}
	\end{center}
\bigskip
\bi 
	\ite 7 bit Port (Portlines \_x[6 ..0])
\ei
	\begin{center}
	\begin{tabular}{c c c c c c}
	  Port  & Addr. PODR\_x & Addr. PDDR\_x & Addr. PPDSDR\_x & Addr PCLR\_x \\
	 \hline
	  DSPI  & A00E & A01E & A02E & A03E \\
	\end{tabular}
	\end{center}

\bigskip
\bi 
	\ite 5 bit Ports (Portlines \_x[4 ..0])
\ei
	\begin{center}
	\begin{tabular}{c c c c c c}
	  Port  & Addr. PODR\_x & Addr. PDDR\_x & Addr. PPDSDR\_x & Addr PCLR\_x \\
	 \hline
	  PCIBG  & A009 & A019 & A029 & A039 \\
	  PCIBR  & A00A & A01A & A02A & A03A \\
	\end{tabular}
	\end{center}

\bigskip
\bi 
	\ite 4 bit Ports (Portlines \_x[3 ..0])
\ei
	\begin{center}
	\begin{tabular}{c c c c c c}
